WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.510
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.510 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 18]

01:51.380 --> 01:52.500
It was that imperial decree

01:52.500 --> 01:54.340
that allowed Her Highness to successfully negotiate peace

01:54.940 --> 01:56.460
with the Lord of Xiaonan.

01:58.500 --> 01:59.220
Now that

01:59.500 --> 02:00.940
she's come here to show her gratitude,

02:01.900 --> 02:03.380
it's evident she's realized

02:04.060 --> 02:05.220
she wouldn't achieve anything

02:06.060 --> 02:07.260
without your support.

02:08.260 --> 02:10.100
Since Her Highness recognizes your capability,

02:10.580 --> 02:11.740
this overture

02:12.820 --> 02:14.620
is probably an attempt at an alliance.

02:14.860 --> 02:16.300
True power lies

02:16.780 --> 02:17.740
only in your own hands.

02:18.380 --> 02:19.500
With Chu Ling dead,

02:20.220 --> 02:22.580
the Yunzhong Prefecture stands defenseless against its enemies.

02:23.300 --> 02:24.780
Even with Zhong Changrong in command,

02:25.380 --> 02:26.100
the Northern Desert

02:26.260 --> 02:27.060
and the Xiaonan Prefecture

02:27.980 --> 02:29.220
are waiting to strike.

02:30.100 --> 02:31.900
A mere treaty

02:31.900 --> 02:32.900
is hardly enough to hold them back.

02:34.820 --> 02:35.780
Back then, Xie Yanfang

02:35.780 --> 02:37.420
defied my deployment order.

02:38.220 --> 02:40.180
Yet, in the relief of Xiaonan Prefecture,

02:40.940 --> 02:42.140
he seized the moment

02:42.140 --> 02:43.580
and siphoned off the spoils.

02:44.900 --> 02:46.300
With the tides shifting,

02:47.020 --> 02:48.020
one must think thrice

02:49.100 --> 02:50.700
before forming any alliance.

02:57.180 --> 02:58.060
Her Highness

02:58.340 --> 02:59.980
is corrupting the noble ladies of the Capital,

03:00.140 --> 03:02.260
encouraging them to parade themselves in public

03:02.700 --> 03:05.060
and organize the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering.

03:06.340 --> 03:07.740
It is utterly laughable.

03:08.740 --> 03:10.540
What self-respecting scholar would attend?

03:10.980 --> 03:11.980
Mr. Jing,

03:11.980 --> 03:12.980
[Jing Ke, Minister Jing's second son]
you truly amuse me.

03:17.020 --> 03:19.300
Why are men free to enjoy literary pursuits,

03:19.820 --> 03:21.020
yet women are denied

03:21.020 --> 03:21.700
the same privilege?

03:22.380 --> 03:23.180
Could it be

03:23.300 --> 03:24.940
you fear being outdone

03:25.220 --> 03:26.020
by women?

03:26.980 --> 03:28.340
Such bold words.

03:28.460 --> 03:29.420
Mr. Jing,

03:29.780 --> 03:30.540
we host this gathering

03:30.540 --> 03:31.820
to let talent

03:31.820 --> 03:33.020
shine,

03:33.420 --> 03:34.500
unlike you

03:34.860 --> 03:36.220
and

03:36.940 --> 03:38.100
your fellow scholars,

03:38.420 --> 03:39.700
who are nothing but incompetents

03:39.780 --> 03:41.500
who slander behind closed doors.

03:42.180 --> 03:43.060
Talent is not something

03:43.500 --> 03:44.900
one can claim as their own.

03:45.820 --> 03:46.940
Your boasting means nothing here.

03:46.940 --> 03:47.340
Good.

03:48.100 --> 03:48.780
Let's

03:48.780 --> 03:49.780
compete today

03:50.260 --> 03:51.900
so all may witness

03:52.380 --> 03:54.340
your true mettle.

03:54.460 --> 03:55.180
Very well.

03:55.220 --> 03:55.980
But if you lose,

03:56.180 --> 03:57.340
stop slandering

03:57.340 --> 03:58.140
our gathering

03:58.380 --> 03:59.620
and never stop others from attending.

03:59.820 --> 04:00.420
Challenge accepted.

04:01.220 --> 04:02.780
Such insolence from a woman.

04:02.900 --> 04:04.580
Please

04:04.660 --> 04:05.420
enlighten me

04:05.500 --> 04:06.420
on Weiqi,

04:06.820 --> 04:07.980
calligraphy,

04:08.100 --> 04:09.100
and other finer arts.

04:17.940 --> 04:18.780
Tang,

04:19.460 --> 04:21.140
can you actually play Weiqi?

04:21.420 --> 04:22.140
I learned

04:22.220 --> 04:23.900
a little from Jiang before.

04:24.380 --> 04:24.980
That's enough

04:26.100 --> 04:26.740
to best him.

04:27.180 --> 04:28.260
What could you possibly learn

04:28.260 --> 04:29.180
from a woman?

04:51.020 --> 04:52.060
Shall we continue?

04:55.580 --> 04:56.580
So what if you can play Weiqi?

04:57.340 --> 04:58.620
It's merely a trifling pastime

04:58.860 --> 05:00.260
for women to occupy themselves with.

05:00.540 --> 05:02.340
- Exactly. - Indeed.

05:02.340 --> 05:03.260
Let us compete in calligraphy instead.

05:03.660 --> 05:04.380
I have spent my time

05:04.380 --> 05:05.460
immersed in literature.

05:06.300 --> 05:06.940
Fine by me.

05:07.820 --> 05:09.340
That's not what I stake

05:09.340 --> 05:10.340
my life upon.

05:11.100 --> 05:12.220
So calligraphy

05:12.340 --> 05:14.020
is merely a pastime for me.

05:21.660 --> 05:23.540
This is truly impressive.

05:23.820 --> 05:24.300
Right.

05:24.660 --> 05:25.620
In fact, it rivals Mr. Jing's work.

05:25.780 --> 05:26.940
She has clearly applied herself.

05:27.940 --> 05:28.340
Look,

05:28.540 --> 05:29.620
she's even varying her strokes.

05:30.420 --> 05:31.300
Quite impressive.

05:31.580 --> 05:33.020
Calligraphy is not about who writes the fastest.

05:33.780 --> 05:34.620
- Indeed. - Exactly.

05:38.340 --> 05:39.140
Mr. Jing,

05:39.580 --> 05:40.380
it is not about who writes

05:40.980 --> 05:42.620
the most either.

05:45.060 --> 05:45.660
Indeed.

05:45.940 --> 05:46.860
She certainly talks tough.

05:56.580 --> 05:58.100
Such clever wordplay.

05:58.740 --> 06:00.060
- Indeed. - Exactly.

06:00.060 --> 06:00.860
Mr. Jing,

06:01.260 --> 06:02.020
do you even have the nerve

06:02.140 --> 06:03.740
to keep slandering our literary gathering?

06:04.300 --> 06:05.380
Best of three.

06:05.740 --> 06:06.260
There is no need

06:06.900 --> 06:08.260
for a third round.

06:09.100 --> 06:10.580
Why further embarrass

06:10.580 --> 06:11.420
yourself?

06:13.180 --> 06:14.660
If you refuse to accept this, Mr. Jing,

06:15.060 --> 06:16.660
you are welcome to attend the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering,

06:16.900 --> 06:18.100
where we can have

06:18.100 --> 06:18.660
a proper contest.

06:20.740 --> 06:21.220
Go.

06:21.500 --> 06:22.220
You're not afraid of her, are you?

06:23.540 --> 06:24.700
- Yes. - Take her on.

06:35.580 --> 06:36.180
Tang.

06:38.740 --> 06:39.700
Does it not trouble you

06:39.700 --> 06:41.220
to have humiliated

06:42.100 --> 06:42.900
Minister Jing's son?

06:43.300 --> 06:44.580
I was only being high-profile

06:44.740 --> 06:45.780
so

06:45.780 --> 06:46.500
they would not underestimate

06:46.500 --> 06:47.540
the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering.

06:48.140 --> 06:48.940
Mr. Jing

06:48.940 --> 06:50.060
has a bit of a reputation,

06:50.340 --> 06:51.380
so after this spectacle,

06:51.740 --> 06:52.780
many will surely come

06:52.780 --> 06:54.380
to the gathering to watch the show.

06:58.780 --> 06:59.820
I have honored

07:00.180 --> 07:01.540
what Zhao entrusted to me.

07:05.140 --> 07:05.540
Let's go.

07:08.180 --> 07:08.940
A literary gathering?

07:10.980 --> 07:12.100
What are you planning

07:12.100 --> 07:13.220
this time?

07:17.940 --> 07:18.940
Who is it?

07:19.780 --> 07:20.380
Mr. Zhang,

07:21.060 --> 07:21.540
it's me.

07:26.820 --> 07:27.260
Young...

07:27.900 --> 07:28.860
Young Master.

07:29.180 --> 07:29.940
I came to see you.

07:31.500 --> 07:31.900
Take a seat.

07:47.900 --> 07:48.940
During the ancestral hall trial,

07:49.820 --> 07:50.460
you were the only one

07:50.460 --> 07:51.500
who did not name me as the arsonist.

07:52.780 --> 07:53.380
I am grateful

07:53.980 --> 07:54.900
for that.

07:56.820 --> 07:58.140
I am but a servant.

07:58.980 --> 08:02.020
What standing do I have to point fingers at you, Young Master?

08:02.540 --> 08:04.620
You need not keep this on your mind.

08:05.860 --> 08:06.660
I shall skip

08:07.540 --> 08:08.620
the liquor.

08:15.540 --> 08:16.380
It's alright,

08:17.900 --> 08:19.540
but can you tell me

08:21.340 --> 08:22.460
if the child brought out

08:22.460 --> 08:23.500
from the Wei Village

08:27.860 --> 08:29.340
is still alive?

08:34.820 --> 08:36.020
[Chu Mansion]

08:36.020 --> 08:36.700
My parents

08:36.700 --> 08:38.100
are settled at the Qiaoshan Academy

08:38.140 --> 08:39.420
and seem to be in much better spirits.

08:40.780 --> 08:41.140
And

08:41.620 --> 08:43.060
the yamen even allotted them a plot of land.

08:45.700 --> 08:46.660
You may keep the land,

08:46.940 --> 08:48.460
but Uncle must accept at least a hundred students

08:48.460 --> 08:49.220
without charging tuition.

08:50.660 --> 08:51.500
You want Father

08:51.940 --> 08:54.100
to use the proceeds from this land

08:54.180 --> 08:55.180
to instruct and enlighten?

08:56.460 --> 08:58.020
He will earn far greater prestige

08:58.220 --> 08:59.740
by serving the people thus.

09:02.740 --> 09:03.860
Father will surely agree.

09:04.380 --> 09:04.860
However,

09:04.940 --> 09:05.900
he has never paid attention

09:05.900 --> 09:06.700
to financial matters.

09:07.100 --> 09:08.060
Mother

09:08.060 --> 09:08.900
will surely regret

09:08.900 --> 09:09.980
this costly venture.

09:10.740 --> 09:12.100
This is a lesson to them both.

09:12.620 --> 09:13.580
Perhaps they will be more cautious

09:13.620 --> 09:14.580
in their future dealings.

09:15.300 --> 09:16.300
Once greed takes hold,

09:16.820 --> 09:18.100
it becomes a trap set by others.

09:18.860 --> 09:19.940
You are indeed insightful.

09:21.820 --> 09:22.300
By the way,

09:22.820 --> 09:24.540
your competition with Mr. Jing

09:24.540 --> 09:26.340
at the teahouse proved quite effective.

09:26.620 --> 09:27.340
Many people

09:27.420 --> 09:28.620
have become interested

09:28.620 --> 09:29.420
in the literary gathering.

09:29.820 --> 09:30.700
That owes entirely

09:30.700 --> 09:31.700
to your brilliant planning.

09:33.620 --> 09:34.340
However, Zhao,

09:34.780 --> 09:36.420
most people

09:36.700 --> 09:37.860
are hoping to see us fail.

09:38.540 --> 09:39.420
They claim

09:39.860 --> 09:41.380
that female scholars

09:41.420 --> 09:42.340
must have ulterior motives,

09:43.260 --> 09:44.180
and that this gathering

09:44.540 --> 09:45.140
is merely a ploy

09:45.140 --> 09:46.580
to secure a good match.

09:47.020 --> 09:47.940
Why must they speak

09:48.100 --> 09:49.900
so harshly?

09:50.500 --> 09:51.580
Let them talk.

09:51.980 --> 09:52.860
Their words mean nothing anyway.

09:54.260 --> 09:55.180
They are

09:55.340 --> 09:56.420
merely men whose pride

09:56.420 --> 09:57.180
has been bruised,

09:57.420 --> 09:58.180
seeking

09:58.180 --> 09:59.460
to salvage their dignity.

10:01.220 --> 10:02.340
On the day of the literary gathering,

10:02.820 --> 10:04.300
we will show them

10:04.940 --> 10:07.140
who the true fools are.

10:10.940 --> 10:12.940
[Chu Mansion Literary Gathering]

10:12.940 --> 10:14.500
Mr. Jing was careless

10:14.620 --> 10:15.420
and lost at Weiqi,

10:16.020 --> 10:17.620
which has made you all

10:17.620 --> 10:18.500
insufferably arrogant.

10:19.380 --> 10:20.940
Today, I will show you

10:21.300 --> 10:23.060
[Peng Yue, Captain Peng's eldest son]
what true shame is.

10:23.300 --> 10:25.500
[Zhou Jiang, noble lady in the Capital]
Careful with your words.

10:26.220 --> 10:27.260
The board will decide.

10:28.220 --> 10:28.820
Fine.

10:29.620 --> 10:30.660
And if you lose,

10:31.420 --> 10:32.340
what then?

10:32.700 --> 10:33.620
If I lose,

10:34.140 --> 10:35.300
I will write a statement of defeat

10:35.740 --> 10:37.420
and never play Weiqi again.

10:37.540 --> 10:39.060
What is that pathetic statement worth?

10:39.540 --> 10:40.620
Does one of your ilk

10:41.060 --> 10:42.780
deserve a seat at a board like this?

10:42.980 --> 10:44.820
Mr. Peng, those are bold words indeed.

10:51.060 --> 10:52.260
I do not feel

10:52.740 --> 10:53.900
that what I said was improper.

10:57.340 --> 10:59.660
If Your Highness insists on flaunting your power,

11:01.020 --> 11:02.260
I shall offer my apologies.

11:02.900 --> 11:04.180
If Miss Zhou loses,

11:04.380 --> 11:06.500
I will write a statement of defeat

11:06.540 --> 11:07.700
with her.

11:08.500 --> 11:10.060
Do you accept this wager?

11:10.740 --> 11:11.300
Zhao.

11:12.860 --> 11:13.940
Your Highness,

11:14.460 --> 11:15.700
why go to such lengths?

11:16.020 --> 11:17.140
Because you are a woman,

11:17.740 --> 11:18.460
and so am I.

11:19.660 --> 11:20.740
If they look down on women,

11:21.260 --> 11:22.820
they look down on all of us.

11:25.180 --> 11:26.620
So this is the real intention behind Your Highness

11:27.060 --> 11:28.020
leading these women

11:28.020 --> 11:29.220
to host a literary gathering.

11:30.180 --> 11:31.500
To back them up, huh?

11:32.820 --> 11:33.220
No.

11:33.940 --> 11:35.860
I only want to tell you

11:36.420 --> 11:37.260
that a woman's move on board

11:37.740 --> 11:38.780
can also decide the fate of the world.

11:47.020 --> 11:47.660
Zhao,

11:48.020 --> 11:48.740
what game

11:48.740 --> 11:49.860
are you playing, exactly?

11:50.620 --> 11:52.140
If they win through sheer luck, that is one thing,

11:53.260 --> 11:54.460
but should they lose,

11:54.980 --> 11:56.580
are you truly prepared

11:57.100 --> 11:58.580
to write a statement of defeat?

11:58.900 --> 11:59.660
It does not matter.

12:00.060 --> 12:00.940
I am not afraid of losing.

12:02.260 --> 12:03.500
So what if I have this title?

12:03.860 --> 12:04.740
Women

12:04.740 --> 12:06.180
have never held their respect.

12:06.980 --> 12:08.340
Even holding a high position

12:08.380 --> 12:10.140
does not make them truly respect me,

12:10.620 --> 12:11.900
so there is nothing to fear.

12:12.900 --> 12:14.500
They come from scholarly families,

12:14.780 --> 12:15.660
so they will not lose.

12:15.980 --> 12:17.060
Even if we lose, it does not matter.

12:17.860 --> 12:18.700
With each competition,

12:19.340 --> 12:20.380
we draw closer

12:20.900 --> 12:21.900
to victory.

12:22.620 --> 12:23.500
And once we win,

12:23.900 --> 12:25.380
today's efforts will not have been in vain.

12:25.980 --> 12:26.900
As I said before,

12:27.220 --> 12:28.100
the purpose of this gathering

12:28.380 --> 12:29.860
is to demonstrate that women

12:30.260 --> 12:31.580
are capable of standing as equals to men.

12:33.500 --> 12:35.140
- She won. - Incredible.

12:35.700 --> 12:36.460
Amazing.

12:38.260 --> 12:39.020
How impressive.

12:39.260 --> 12:40.020
We are taught

12:40.780 --> 12:42.260
from childhood to read, write,

12:42.460 --> 12:43.260
and master the Six Arts,

12:44.060 --> 12:45.300
yet, we are also told

12:45.660 --> 12:46.500
that all such learning serves

12:47.020 --> 12:48.660
to secure a good marriage,

12:49.380 --> 12:50.500
to support our husbands, raise our children,

12:50.700 --> 12:51.660
and please our husbands' families.

12:52.980 --> 12:53.820
But today,

12:54.460 --> 12:55.100
we seek

12:55.100 --> 12:56.220
no one's favor.

12:57.380 --> 12:59.900
We are fighting for our own reputation.

13:06.860 --> 13:07.380
Your Highness,

13:07.820 --> 13:08.580
a letter from His Lordship.

13:18.780 --> 13:19.580
Father says

13:21.100 --> 13:23.020
the turmoil in the Capital has only paused for now,

13:24.300 --> 13:25.900
and I should wait with patience.

13:28.900 --> 13:29.580
And yet

13:30.940 --> 13:32.780
every move he ever taught me

13:34.500 --> 13:36.100
was built to kill.

13:39.220 --> 13:39.780
His Lordship

13:39.780 --> 13:40.700
still cares for you, Your Highness.

13:42.940 --> 13:43.460
Tie Ying,

13:44.420 --> 13:45.020
grind the ink.

13:46.180 --> 13:46.660
Yes.

13:52.740 --> 13:53.740
Are you writing back, Your Highness?

13:58.220 --> 13:59.540
I'm writing to Deng Yi.

14:01.860 --> 14:02.620
Mr. Deng?

14:04.020 --> 14:04.700
He helped us

14:05.220 --> 14:06.660
flee the Capital,

14:07.380 --> 14:08.740
and yet Chu Zhao never moved against him.

14:09.460 --> 14:10.820
There must be some pact between them.

14:11.540 --> 14:12.700
The way things stand,

14:13.260 --> 14:13.980
he and we

14:14.220 --> 14:15.220
may no longer share the same side.

14:15.700 --> 14:17.580
Whether we are or not doesn't matter.

14:19.100 --> 14:20.580
What he owes me...

14:24.780 --> 14:26.420
comes before all else.

14:44.100 --> 14:44.660
Your Highness.

14:45.700 --> 14:46.660
Since when do you bother

14:46.980 --> 14:48.300
with such formalities?

14:50.580 --> 14:51.900
I hope

14:52.140 --> 14:53.260
I'm not interrupting.

14:55.100 --> 14:56.260
I came across a jade disc

14:56.740 --> 14:58.020
and wanted to give it to you.

15:01.420 --> 15:02.500
Smooth to the touch,

15:03.060 --> 15:04.060
flawless in color.

15:04.980 --> 15:06.620
A rare piece indeed.

15:09.300 --> 15:10.260
My gratitude.

15:11.820 --> 15:12.300
Your Highness,

15:13.300 --> 15:13.780
please.

15:15.740 --> 15:17.020
Your Highness comes at such a late hour.

15:17.980 --> 15:19.140
I can only assume it is a matter of urgency.

15:20.100 --> 15:21.420
I've received word

15:22.300 --> 15:24.180
that the Northern Desert King has turned back.

15:24.820 --> 15:25.980
There may be movement on the frontier.

15:30.300 --> 15:31.260
I heard

15:31.540 --> 15:32.740
you once tried to send a trusted general

15:32.740 --> 15:33.900
to Yunzhong Prefecture,

15:34.860 --> 15:35.620
only for Mr. Xie

15:36.020 --> 15:37.900
to block it with the Grand Princess Token.

15:38.860 --> 15:40.460
Your concern for Yunzhong

15:40.740 --> 15:41.900
moves me,

15:42.820 --> 15:43.900
which is why I've come

15:44.140 --> 15:45.900
to discuss the appointment of Guard General with you.

15:46.900 --> 15:48.020
What do you think of Xie Yanlai?

15:53.180 --> 15:54.820
You're locked in a contest with the Xie Clan,

15:55.540 --> 15:56.820
and yet you'd hand command of the frontier troops

15:56.820 --> 15:57.820
to one of their own?

15:58.980 --> 16:00.100
I warned you before,

16:00.740 --> 16:02.420
the Imperial Guard's authority must never be entrusted so lightly.

16:02.420 --> 16:04.260
And now the frontier troops are in Xie Yanlai's hands once again.

16:05.500 --> 16:06.780
Do you truly trust him,

16:07.540 --> 16:08.700
or are you counting on Xie Yanfang

16:08.700 --> 16:09.380
not daring to touch him?

16:10.300 --> 16:11.740
Xie Yanlai serves me

16:12.020 --> 16:13.100
and has nothing to do with the Xie Family.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.460
Your Highness may say so,

16:15.540 --> 16:16.980
but to the rest of the world,

16:18.380 --> 16:19.300
he is a Xie.

16:20.380 --> 16:22.180
If the day comes when Xie Yanfang forces him to choose,

16:22.260 --> 16:22.980
Your Highness, what do you think

16:23.660 --> 16:24.580
he would do?

16:24.980 --> 16:26.100
He would choose me.

16:39.740 --> 16:41.460
Since Your Highness has made up your mind,

16:43.020 --> 16:44.300
I won't press further.

16:44.820 --> 16:46.660
I only hope that when victory comes from the frontier,

16:46.780 --> 16:48.300
the glory won't end up adorning someone else.

16:49.700 --> 16:50.780
You worry too much.

16:53.020 --> 16:53.500
The jade

16:54.460 --> 16:55.340
is fine.

16:56.700 --> 16:58.820
It just needs the most delicate of hands.

17:03.180 --> 17:04.700
She actually went to Deng Yi.

17:05.860 --> 17:06.300
Yes.

17:06.980 --> 17:07.900
They talked in private for quite some time.

17:10.460 --> 17:11.180
Seems Chu Zhao

17:11.180 --> 17:12.740
already sees me as a rival,

17:13.900 --> 17:15.620
and means to use Deng Yi to restrain me.

17:17.420 --> 17:18.340
Their next move

17:19.620 --> 17:21.900
should be to put Yanlai in command of the frontier troops.

17:22.860 --> 17:24.580
If the military authority falls to the Xie Clan,

17:24.940 --> 17:25.940
it is actually advantageous.

17:26.420 --> 17:26.820
No.

17:28.180 --> 17:29.580
Yanlai has changed.

17:32.140 --> 17:32.900
Fortunately,

17:34.220 --> 17:35.020
I still have

17:35.020 --> 17:36.460
a more obedient lapdog.

17:36.900 --> 17:37.380
Mr. Xie,

17:37.700 --> 17:38.820
your foresight is truly remarkable.

17:41.140 --> 17:42.540
Though a piece be small,

17:43.420 --> 17:44.300
if used well,

17:45.060 --> 17:46.820
it can still stir the winds of change.

17:48.180 --> 17:49.220
Have you met

17:49.540 --> 17:50.740
with Xiao Xun lately?

17:54.020 --> 17:55.220
He's a hostage.

17:55.900 --> 17:56.940
It wouldn't be proper for me to visit him.

17:57.820 --> 17:58.900
As Grand Mentor,

18:00.180 --> 18:01.460
you must extend your compassion to all,

18:01.460 --> 18:02.220
be they the common folk

18:03.100 --> 18:04.100
or the officials of the court.

18:05.420 --> 18:06.140
Keeping

18:06.580 --> 18:08.540
such a deliberate distance from him

18:09.700 --> 18:11.060
will raise suspicions.

18:13.260 --> 18:14.700
Your Highness has made clear

18:14.700 --> 18:15.820
I should stand with you.

18:16.780 --> 18:18.100
Why test me?

18:19.380 --> 18:20.220
Unless

18:21.900 --> 18:23.220
there's been talk

18:23.220 --> 18:24.180
about me?

18:27.060 --> 18:27.660
Nothing of the sort.

18:29.020 --> 18:30.100
Just making conversation.

18:30.540 --> 18:31.140
Your Highness,

18:32.180 --> 18:33.780
I give everything I have

18:34.100 --> 18:36.100
to the State of Chu, to my last breath.

18:37.180 --> 18:38.260
My loyalty is absolute.

18:42.020 --> 18:43.260
I know

18:44.100 --> 18:45.420
where your loyalty lies.

18:47.660 --> 18:48.300
It's late.

18:49.540 --> 18:50.620
I should not keep you any longer.

18:57.580 --> 18:58.900
As for the appointment of the commander,

18:59.860 --> 19:02.460
I hope you will give it further careful consideration.

19:03.420 --> 19:04.700
Do not rush into a decision.

19:18.620 --> 19:19.180
Mr. Deng,

19:20.100 --> 19:21.380
Her Highness and you

19:21.540 --> 19:22.220
have gone your separate ways.

19:22.340 --> 19:22.980
I know.

19:24.460 --> 19:25.500
In this game,

19:26.900 --> 19:27.980
the isolated stone

19:27.980 --> 19:28.940
is always the first to fall.

19:29.700 --> 19:31.420
We must plan ahead

19:31.740 --> 19:32.700
and do what we must

19:33.900 --> 19:34.620
to survive.

19:36.620 --> 19:37.140
Mr. Deng,

19:37.540 --> 19:38.940
this is a letter from Mr. Xiao.

19:46.940 --> 19:49.740
My divination has progressed considerably.

19:50.500 --> 19:52.420
I finally understand what it means for greatness yet to emerge.

19:53.220 --> 19:55.740
And I've never thanked you for your guidance.

20:33.620 --> 20:35.140
These palace robes are such a bother,

20:35.420 --> 20:36.380
so stiff

20:36.540 --> 20:37.340
and confining.

20:38.060 --> 20:38.660
They're nothing

20:38.660 --> 20:39.580
like the simple clothes I wore before.

20:40.420 --> 20:41.700
Clumsy as you are,

20:41.700 --> 20:42.860
how could you serve our lady?

20:42.980 --> 20:43.420
Give it to me.

20:44.420 --> 20:44.940
Le,

20:45.580 --> 20:47.580
take her to change into something lighter.

20:47.980 --> 20:49.020
She need not dress like a palace maid.

20:49.660 --> 20:50.660
Cold mask, warm heart.

20:50.900 --> 20:51.940
You're just like your mother, Your Highness.

20:53.500 --> 20:54.140
Mother?

20:54.900 --> 20:55.580
Whose mother?

20:56.220 --> 20:57.420
Your Highness's mother?

20:57.820 --> 20:59.020
Also my aunt.

21:00.700 --> 21:01.540
Don't ask any more.

21:03.540 --> 21:05.580
I once read Her Highness's fortune.

21:06.340 --> 21:07.860
The divination showed her mother was still alive.

21:08.460 --> 21:09.020
I thought I had misread

21:09.020 --> 21:10.420
the cracks in the tortoise shell.

21:12.140 --> 21:13.060
You can read fortunes?

21:13.420 --> 21:14.300
That accurately?

21:15.380 --> 21:16.380
Cast one for me too, would you?

21:17.860 --> 21:18.300
No.

21:19.860 --> 21:20.740
Fine.

21:24.100 --> 21:25.260
Alright, I'll do it.

21:36.900 --> 21:37.700
Well?

21:39.140 --> 21:40.100
A letter from afar.

21:40.740 --> 21:42.100
You can tell that from the bones?

21:43.500 --> 21:44.620
I used my eyes.

21:49.300 --> 21:49.780
Your Highness,

21:49.980 --> 21:50.700
a message from the dispatch rider.

21:54.540 --> 21:55.660
It's from Xie Yanlai.

22:11.260 --> 22:12.060
[It's found in Wei Village, possibly tied to the case.]

22:12.060 --> 22:12.660
[Origin unclear.]
What is it?

22:12.660 --> 22:13.260
[All's well. Return date unknown.]

22:13.260 --> 22:15.140
Jiu discovered shards of incendiary jars

22:15.380 --> 22:16.660
in the Wei Village ruins,

22:17.300 --> 22:18.020
bearing part

22:18.020 --> 22:19.140
of a cargo mark.

22:21.220 --> 22:22.500
Incendiary jars?

22:22.980 --> 22:24.620
Someone used them to set fires?

22:26.020 --> 22:26.660
[Xinsi, Fourth Month, Danqiu Horse Administration]

22:26.660 --> 22:28.220
[Contract Three]
Xinsi, Fourth Month.

22:28.340 --> 22:29.380
Danqiu Horse Administration.

22:29.900 --> 22:31.340
Contract Three.

22:32.460 --> 22:33.500
What does that mean?

22:34.100 --> 22:35.260
Danqiu refers to

22:35.260 --> 22:36.260
the Xiaonan Prefecture stud farm.

22:39.180 --> 22:40.820
This came from Xiaonan Prefecture.

22:44.020 --> 22:45.180
Mr. Deng is thoughtful,

22:45.660 --> 22:46.500
looking out for Your Highness.

22:47.060 --> 22:48.300
I've heard

22:48.700 --> 22:49.700
that someone has been investigating

22:49.820 --> 22:50.780
the Wei Village in secret.

22:51.340 --> 22:52.580
But after the village was burned,

22:53.380 --> 22:55.020
all the cargo records from Xiaonan Prefecture

22:55.020 --> 22:55.980
were destroyed.

22:57.100 --> 22:58.540
There's no way to uncover the truth.

22:59.180 --> 23:00.300
Yet I worry someone won't let this go

23:00.980 --> 23:01.980
and will seize the chance to stir up trouble.

23:13.020 --> 23:14.660
Your concerns are not without merit.

23:16.420 --> 23:16.820
Go

23:17.780 --> 23:18.860
and keep close watch.

23:19.940 --> 23:20.820
Nothing

23:20.820 --> 23:21.820
can come to light.

23:22.380 --> 23:23.780
If that fire at the Wei Village

23:25.740 --> 23:27.340
ever gets traced back to us,

23:27.620 --> 23:29.020
the charge of colluding with the Northern Desert

23:30.540 --> 23:31.100
would finish us

23:31.100 --> 23:32.460
for good.

23:33.980 --> 23:34.420
Understood.

24:12.580 --> 24:14.140
Still expecting your father to rescue you?

24:18.660 --> 24:21.060
Xiaonan Prefecture can barely stay afloat.

24:21.420 --> 24:22.580
As his stone,

24:23.460 --> 24:24.300
you are certainly spent.

24:24.980 --> 24:26.660
Your Highness came all this way

24:27.900 --> 24:28.740
only to offer

24:28.740 --> 24:30.220
such hollow mockery?

24:30.860 --> 24:31.300
No.

24:32.340 --> 24:33.740
I came to tell you

24:35.100 --> 24:36.540
that I could choose not to kill you,

24:36.980 --> 24:37.740
but I could also keep you

24:37.740 --> 24:39.060
in the Capital,

24:39.460 --> 24:40.860
a hostage until your last breath.

24:42.780 --> 24:43.660
I know your father

24:43.660 --> 24:44.580
sent you a letter.

24:46.100 --> 24:47.700
Do you really think he wants to rescue you?

24:49.140 --> 24:49.980
This letter

24:50.340 --> 24:51.660
appears to offer reassurance,

24:52.380 --> 24:53.380
but it is meant

24:53.380 --> 24:54.500
to keep you here.

24:55.540 --> 24:56.740
If you attempt to flee,

24:57.300 --> 24:59.260
you prove that Xiaonan Prefecture plotted this all along,

25:00.060 --> 25:01.540
committing treason and deceiving His Majesty.

25:09.580 --> 25:10.980
Do you know what he said to me

25:11.420 --> 25:12.820
in Xiaonan Prefecture?

25:13.740 --> 25:15.580
"I have one wife

25:16.740 --> 25:17.980
and three concubines,

25:18.540 --> 25:20.140
- with seven children in total." - Enough.

25:22.820 --> 25:23.420
What?

25:24.940 --> 25:25.980
Are you furious?

25:27.620 --> 25:29.460
Helplessness feels awful,

25:30.260 --> 25:31.220
doesn't it?

25:31.860 --> 25:32.780
Your Highness.

25:34.780 --> 25:36.300
Why back me into a corner like this?

25:37.220 --> 25:38.540
You're pressing so relentlessly

25:39.100 --> 25:41.060
just to hear me say

25:42.140 --> 25:43.580
that I want to go back to Xiaonan Prefecture, aren't you?

25:50.700 --> 25:51.860
But I won't say it.

25:54.260 --> 25:55.780
I like this courtyard.

25:56.820 --> 25:58.620
Small and delicate.

26:00.980 --> 26:02.420
Your Highness, I wish you

26:03.500 --> 26:05.140
confined to these walls forever.

26:07.380 --> 26:07.980
Let's see

26:08.660 --> 26:10.500
whether you're destined to rise...

26:12.900 --> 26:14.260
or doomed to fade away.

26:25.780 --> 26:27.780
[Chu Mansion]

26:28.620 --> 26:29.220
Zhao,

26:30.020 --> 26:31.300
Jiang was brilliant,

26:31.420 --> 26:32.620
besting one scholar after another

26:32.900 --> 26:33.980
at the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering.

26:34.940 --> 26:36.700
A triumph for women indeed.

26:37.820 --> 26:38.820
Jiang's mastery of Weiqi

26:39.020 --> 26:39.580
was always meant

26:39.580 --> 26:40.980
to shine on a larger board.

26:42.420 --> 26:43.940
All these years of dedicated study,

26:44.060 --> 26:45.700
and now the world finally understands

26:45.900 --> 26:47.220
the board makes no distinction

26:47.420 --> 26:48.860
between men and women.

26:52.980 --> 26:53.460
By the way,

26:54.060 --> 26:54.820
I heard

26:55.060 --> 26:56.420
Mr. Deng has been withholding

26:56.460 --> 26:57.660
military honors

26:57.660 --> 26:58.540
from the Battle Against the Northern Desert,

26:59.020 --> 27:00.700
leaving the court rife with speculation.

27:01.540 --> 27:02.380
Do you know

27:02.460 --> 27:03.860
what game he is playing?

27:04.540 --> 27:05.540
What else could it be?

27:06.140 --> 27:07.060
The only one

27:07.180 --> 27:08.660
he means to hold back is Xie Yanlai.

27:09.300 --> 27:11.020
With the Guard General post vacant,

27:11.580 --> 27:12.740
every ambitious eye in court

27:12.820 --> 27:14.100
is set upon it.

27:14.820 --> 27:15.980
Do you really think

27:16.580 --> 27:17.820
he would stand with you?

27:20.340 --> 27:21.060
Your Highness,

27:21.540 --> 27:23.460
are you considering sending Xie Yanlai to guard the frontier?

27:26.700 --> 27:29.220
Yunzhong Prefecture is a key stronghold on the frontier,

27:30.380 --> 27:31.780
and he was the one

27:31.780 --> 27:32.820
Father and Mr. Zhong chose.

27:34.100 --> 27:35.180
But he comes from the Xie Family,

27:35.660 --> 27:37.460
and Deng Yi has always been wary of them holding military power,

27:38.060 --> 27:38.900
not to mention

27:40.580 --> 27:42.380
over a fortress like Yunzhong.

27:45.620 --> 27:46.340
So...

27:48.180 --> 27:49.460
I'm going to force the issue

27:49.980 --> 27:51.220
at court.

28:06.100 --> 28:06.860
Mr. Deng,

28:07.660 --> 28:08.780
why is Xie Yanlai absent

28:08.780 --> 28:09.780
from the list of honors

28:10.340 --> 28:11.340
for the Battle Against the Northern Desert?

28:12.740 --> 28:13.860
Breaking through Yingzui Valley

28:14.220 --> 28:15.460
and dealing a heavy blow to the Northern Desert King.

28:15.940 --> 28:17.500
Do these not deserve the highest commendation?

28:18.420 --> 28:20.180
Moreover, he was personally recommended

28:20.180 --> 28:21.140
by the late General Chu

28:21.860 --> 28:24.300
as the most qualified successor for Guard General.

28:25.140 --> 28:26.820
The post is of critical importance

28:27.460 --> 28:29.980
and cannot simply be dictated.

28:30.980 --> 28:32.100
If it were a hereditary title,

28:32.500 --> 28:33.980
the person most fit to lead the frontier troops

28:33.980 --> 28:35.420
would be Your Highness.

28:36.060 --> 28:37.580
Unfortunately, as you cannot hold the post yourself,

28:38.260 --> 28:41.100
someone else must take the place.

28:42.060 --> 28:43.060
Furthermore,

28:43.740 --> 28:45.620
when Your Highness appointed Xie Yanlai

28:45.620 --> 28:46.900
as Imperial Guard Commander,

28:47.380 --> 28:49.180
he deserted his duties.

28:50.060 --> 28:51.500
According to the law, he should be executed.

28:52.780 --> 28:53.700
How could there be any rewards?

28:56.420 --> 28:57.620
Mr. Xie, do you remember

28:58.580 --> 28:59.620
that if Xie Yanlai

28:59.620 --> 29:01.420
had not detected the unrest in Xiaonan Prefecture,

29:01.700 --> 29:02.620
Xiao Xun's blade

29:03.340 --> 29:05.300
would already be at His Majesty's throat?

29:06.020 --> 29:07.300
Why are you so bent

29:07.300 --> 29:08.300
on castigating Commander Xie?

29:10.020 --> 29:12.460
Even if Your Highness orders my death,

29:13.300 --> 29:14.740
I must speak.

29:15.860 --> 29:16.980
The law is absolute

29:17.500 --> 29:18.540
and cannot be overturned.

29:18.820 --> 29:20.860
Xie Yanlai defied imperial orders, and that is a fact.

29:21.980 --> 29:23.180
If he is not severely punished,

29:23.900 --> 29:25.740
I fear others will follow suit,

29:26.140 --> 29:27.900
and the court will descend into chaos.

29:28.740 --> 29:30.380
What is your take on this?

29:31.260 --> 29:33.580
By law, he deserves death.

29:45.820 --> 29:47.820
[Xie Residence]

29:55.940 --> 29:57.260
Yanlai has returned to the Capital?

29:58.020 --> 29:59.020
But strangely,

29:59.340 --> 30:00.380
from the You hour the day before yesterday

30:00.380 --> 30:01.100
until the Zi hour last night,

30:01.460 --> 30:02.740
he left no trace.

30:03.340 --> 30:04.460
Our people lost him.

30:05.380 --> 30:06.500
This is interesting.

30:07.340 --> 30:08.780
He is not by Chu Zhao's side

30:09.780 --> 30:11.020
but chooses to move alone.

30:12.820 --> 30:14.700
Something serious must be happening.

30:15.900 --> 30:16.660
No matter.

30:17.500 --> 30:18.620
Keep watching him.

30:22.740 --> 30:23.820
How is the court?

30:24.460 --> 30:25.540
Mr. Xie, your plan was brilliant.

30:25.860 --> 30:27.140
You feigned illness and absented yourself this morning.

30:27.340 --> 30:28.460
The court has indeed seen stirrings.

30:28.940 --> 30:30.300
Her Highness requested that Xie Yanlai be named

30:30.500 --> 30:32.260
Guard General on the grounds of his military achievements.

30:33.540 --> 30:34.580
How did Mr. Deng react?

30:34.900 --> 30:36.140
He immediately claimed

30:36.500 --> 30:37.980
Xie Yanlai had abandoned his duties

30:38.340 --> 30:39.540
and should be executed.

30:40.420 --> 30:42.020
If he actually kills Yanlai,

30:42.940 --> 30:45.100
Her Highness will surely not let it go.

30:45.900 --> 30:47.580
But if Her Highness grants the title,

30:48.980 --> 30:50.940
our military power will grow even stronger.

30:52.100 --> 30:53.740
A true dilemma.

30:54.940 --> 30:55.700
There is one more thing.

30:57.220 --> 30:58.060
Deng Yi has met with Xiao Xun

30:58.060 --> 30:59.140
three times recently,

30:59.500 --> 31:01.020
always after the Zi hour.

31:01.620 --> 31:02.300
Interesting.

31:05.220 --> 31:07.140
Mr. Deng usually knows how to read the wind.

31:07.940 --> 31:08.580
Why

31:08.580 --> 31:10.460
cling to a dead branch now?

31:13.820 --> 31:14.660
Perhaps Xiao Xun has

31:14.660 --> 31:15.820
something else planned?

31:16.540 --> 31:17.180
Should we take precautions

31:17.180 --> 31:18.260
in advance?

31:20.100 --> 31:20.940
Let us wait and see.

31:23.900 --> 31:25.580
Do not alert him.

31:27.500 --> 31:27.980
Understood.

31:36.740 --> 31:39.380
Her Highness has arrived.

31:49.940 --> 31:50.900
Your Highness.

31:51.820 --> 31:53.020
Yanfang, your health comes first.

31:53.300 --> 31:53.980
There's no need for such formalities.

31:54.540 --> 31:55.460
It seems

31:56.660 --> 31:58.420
nothing escapes Your Highness's keen eyes.

32:02.140 --> 32:03.420
I am deeply honored by your visit.

32:04.020 --> 32:04.580
Please, this way.

32:13.740 --> 32:14.300
Your Highness,

32:15.180 --> 32:17.020
Yanlai is indeed important to you,

32:17.780 --> 32:19.420
but are you not afraid that Deng Yi

32:20.380 --> 32:21.580
will seize this opportunity to strike?

32:24.060 --> 32:25.980
Xie Yanlai is your brother.

32:26.860 --> 32:28.460
Deng Yi is clamoring for his blood,

32:29.940 --> 32:31.740
yet you sit here with your hands folded?

32:32.540 --> 32:34.620
Your Highness truly misjudges me.

32:36.780 --> 32:37.700
As his elder brother,

32:37.700 --> 32:38.620
I have shouldered so much

32:38.620 --> 32:39.820
for Yanlai since we were children.

32:41.180 --> 32:42.780
The Xie Family has stood for a century.

32:43.060 --> 32:44.420
I cannot let

32:44.460 --> 32:45.340
his reckless behavior

32:46.180 --> 32:47.700
endanger the entire clan.

32:49.020 --> 32:50.700
I want to save him more than anyone,

32:52.420 --> 32:53.540
but now...

32:55.620 --> 32:56.740
my hands are tied.

32:57.940 --> 32:59.340
Tied?

33:00.780 --> 33:02.780
Your acting now matches

33:03.620 --> 33:05.620
your mastery of the game.

33:07.860 --> 33:09.300
Shouldering for him, you say?

33:11.340 --> 33:12.180
You are fully aware

33:12.180 --> 33:13.700
that he never set fire to the Wei village.

33:15.060 --> 33:15.940
Yet why

33:16.540 --> 33:17.740
did you allow

33:18.220 --> 33:19.420
this crime to be placed upon him?

33:22.340 --> 33:24.220
It was to use this as leverage

33:25.580 --> 33:28.060
to restrain the most dangerous threat within the Xie Family.

33:39.460 --> 33:40.620
You know.

33:41.260 --> 33:42.180
Regardless,

33:42.900 --> 33:44.180
Xie Yanlai holding military power

33:44.500 --> 33:45.860
is beneficial to the Xie Family.

33:46.980 --> 33:48.420
I hope

33:49.220 --> 33:50.260
you will lend your support.

34:04.780 --> 34:06.020
She has changed

34:08.500 --> 34:10.380
anyway.

34:18.460 --> 34:19.300
Why are you still awake?

34:19.740 --> 34:20.540
I don't want to sleep.

34:21.140 --> 34:22.140
Every time I close my eyes,

34:22.380 --> 34:23.420
I think of

34:23.420 --> 34:25.100
Mr. Deng's outburst in court today.

34:25.420 --> 34:26.620
He says Uncle Yanlai should be killed,

34:27.180 --> 34:28.460
but I do not want to kill him.

34:31.900 --> 34:32.500
Rest assured.

34:33.340 --> 34:34.340
Tomorrow in court,

34:34.580 --> 34:35.140
I will make

34:35.140 --> 34:36.460
everyone realize

34:37.300 --> 34:38.980
who is truly worthy of trust.

34:40.340 --> 34:41.380
You have a plan?

34:43.060 --> 34:44.220
You will see tomorrow.

34:44.780 --> 34:45.300
Go to sleep.

35:26.420 --> 35:27.100
You have returned.

35:28.500 --> 35:29.060
I have.

35:55.940 --> 35:56.980
Have you found any clues?

35:58.220 --> 35:59.340
I have uncovered some details

35:59.380 --> 36:00.380
about the Wei Village incident,

36:01.700 --> 36:02.700
but it involves many parties.

36:03.500 --> 36:04.860
I need to conduct a more thorough investigation.

36:05.500 --> 36:06.580
Is it related

36:06.580 --> 36:08.060
to the incendiary jar fragments you sent back?

36:11.780 --> 36:12.900
You went back to Gaoyang

36:13.380 --> 36:14.660
to investigate the Bloodburn Pill,

36:16.020 --> 36:17.340
so how did it lead to the Wei Village?

36:19.780 --> 36:21.060
I did not find the Bloodburn Pill

36:22.100 --> 36:23.780
in the Xie Family's medicinal storage.

36:24.580 --> 36:25.780
Instead, I discovered

36:26.380 --> 36:27.660
that Xie Yanfang is using a type of medicine

36:28.580 --> 36:29.820
to keep a child alive.

36:30.580 --> 36:31.420
A child?

36:33.900 --> 36:34.420
Xiang?

36:36.740 --> 36:37.740
Although I have not found

36:37.740 --> 36:38.700
where he is hidden,

36:39.500 --> 36:40.340
I believe

36:41.700 --> 36:42.820
he is alive.

36:44.140 --> 36:45.620
Xie Yanfang keeping him hidden

36:46.540 --> 36:47.620
must have something to do

36:47.620 --> 36:48.660
with that fire back then.

36:54.060 --> 36:55.140
That incendiary jar fragment

36:55.780 --> 36:56.460
clearly bore

36:56.460 --> 36:57.740
the caravan mark of Xiaonan Prefecture.

36:58.260 --> 36:59.020
The oil

36:59.780 --> 37:01.260
was definitely from there.

37:02.020 --> 37:03.460
Yet, the mark left at the scene

37:03.820 --> 37:04.780
belongs to the Cangmu Stronghold.

37:05.300 --> 37:06.260
It's

37:07.180 --> 37:08.060
a blatant frame-up.

37:08.540 --> 37:09.220
You mean

37:09.740 --> 37:11.060
someone wanted to use that fire

37:11.780 --> 37:12.620
to force my mother out?

37:13.460 --> 37:14.380
What secret

37:14.620 --> 37:15.380
does the Cangmu Stronghold have

37:15.380 --> 37:16.380
that requires such drastic measures?

37:17.700 --> 37:18.820
It must be your mother's identity

37:19.180 --> 37:20.460
as a Northern Desert general.

37:23.100 --> 37:23.940
If someone intended

37:23.940 --> 37:24.780
to use that fire

37:25.380 --> 37:26.780
to provoke an imperial investigation into the Cangmu Stronghold,

37:27.780 --> 37:29.540
your mother's identity would certainly be exposed.

37:30.620 --> 37:32.060
Your father would have been accused of deceiving His Majesty

37:32.820 --> 37:33.900
and stripped of his position.

37:35.580 --> 37:37.100
This must be the Northern Desert King's doing.

37:38.860 --> 37:40.220
A scheme this interconnected

37:40.860 --> 37:41.740
cannot be executed

37:41.740 --> 37:42.620
without an insider.

37:43.260 --> 37:44.460
Xiao Xun left

37:44.460 --> 37:45.060
no loose ends.

37:46.140 --> 37:47.420
I need concrete evidence.

37:48.660 --> 37:49.860
Is there anything I can do?

37:50.940 --> 37:51.500
Zhao,

37:53.380 --> 37:54.660
this matter involves far more than you know.

37:55.220 --> 37:56.100
It touches on your mother

37:56.940 --> 37:58.180
and your origins.

37:59.500 --> 38:00.940
So you must do nothing.

38:01.660 --> 38:02.540
Should you be discovered,

38:02.780 --> 38:03.500
disaster will follow.

38:05.180 --> 38:05.700
Zhao,

38:06.780 --> 38:07.700
what happened at Wei Village

38:07.980 --> 38:09.700
matters greatly to both of us.

38:10.540 --> 38:11.700
I will get

38:12.100 --> 38:13.100
to the bottom of it,

38:13.740 --> 38:14.860
but I will investigate with care

38:15.620 --> 38:16.940
and ensure Xie Yanfang remains unaware.

38:18.540 --> 38:19.020
Zhao,

38:19.980 --> 38:21.580
I have heard about what happened at court.

38:22.940 --> 38:24.180
If you truly insist on defending me,

38:25.020 --> 38:25.940
Mr. Deng will certainly weaponize

38:25.940 --> 38:27.220
my unauthorized absence against you,

38:28.180 --> 38:30.140
and he might even force you to step aside from governance.

38:33.140 --> 38:34.540
But you earned your military merits.

38:38.660 --> 38:39.700
I used to seek

38:40.940 --> 38:41.780
only to die on the battlefield

38:42.740 --> 38:43.540
for a moment's glory,

38:45.060 --> 38:46.740
but now, I only want to live long enough

38:48.660 --> 38:49.660
to keep one person safe.

38:57.540 --> 38:58.340
Who is that person?

38:59.820 --> 39:00.660
General Xie,

39:01.940 --> 39:02.860
you might as well be clear.

39:05.220 --> 39:08.880
♪Day after day, across these ancient hills♪

39:08.880 --> 39:12.720
♪Again and again, the old city cold and still♪

39:12.720 --> 39:15.520
♪Through dust and battle, I look back♪

39:15.520 --> 39:18.960
♪And find you waiting at journey's end♪

39:20.180 --> 39:24.000
♪Night after night, the hours drift on♪

39:24.000 --> 39:27.560
♪Year after year, our reunions end too soon♪

39:27.560 --> 39:33.640
♪Love so deep, yet fate so thin, why must it be so hard?♪

39:34.740 --> 39:37.540
♪Through joy and sorrow, we have shared it all♪

39:37.540 --> 39:38.780
Would you ever lie to me?

39:38.780 --> 39:42.040
♪Bound by a knowing no words can name♪

39:42.340 --> 39:45.130
♪Two lonely souls, huddling together for warmth♪

39:45.140 --> 39:45.660
Never.

39:47.300 --> 39:47.820
Zhao.

39:49.140 --> 39:49.900
By the moon itself,

39:49.900 --> 39:52.340
♪You say this life is naught but endless partings♪

39:52.340 --> 39:53.260
I never will.

39:53.640 --> 39:57.200
♪I sigh at the whims of merciless fate♪

39:57.520 --> 40:00.960
♪I'm holding on alone♪

40:01.400 --> 40:04.680
♪Yet across the vast divide♪

40:04.680 --> 40:08.840
♪You feel the ripple too♪

40:11.020 --> 40:11.860
My father wished you

40:11.860 --> 40:13.180
to take command of the frontier troops.

40:16.580 --> 40:17.220
Would you do it?

40:18.060 --> 40:18.980
For you and the General,

40:20.660 --> 40:22.380
there's nothing I wouldn't do.

40:23.460 --> 40:24.300
But you must promise me

40:25.700 --> 40:26.940
never again to put yourself in harm's way

40:27.180 --> 40:28.220
to deal with Deng Yi alone.

40:29.540 --> 40:30.380
Tomorrow at court,

40:31.420 --> 40:32.260
I'll fight for it myself.

40:35.560 --> 40:39.280
♪Through joy and sorrow, we have shared it all♪

40:39.580 --> 40:43.280
♪Bound by a knowing no words can name♪

40:43.280 --> 40:46.960
♪I'm holding on alone♪

40:46.960 --> 40:50.640
♪Yet across the vast divide♪

40:50.640 --> 40:54.880
♪You feel the ripple too♪

41:01.580 --> 41:02.700
I petition again

41:02.940 --> 41:04.420
for Liang Qiang's appointment.

41:04.620 --> 41:05.180
It cannot be allowed.

41:10.980 --> 41:12.580
Your Highness, your persistent meddling in state affairs

41:13.220 --> 41:15.020
is strictly prohibited in the inner palace.

41:15.740 --> 41:17.060
I implore you, Your Highness,

41:17.060 --> 41:18.340
to withdraw to the Grand Princess's Residence

41:18.780 --> 41:20.420
and never again interfere in affairs of state.

41:23.740 --> 41:24.860
I, Xie Yanlai,

41:25.620 --> 41:26.620
pay my respect to Your Majesty,

41:27.540 --> 41:29.020
and Your Highness.

41:39.420 --> 41:39.900
I pledge

41:40.580 --> 41:41.860
my life on my duty.

41:43.020 --> 41:43.660
Within half a year...

41:45.100 --> 41:46.460
I shall claim the Northern Desert King's head.

41:47.580 --> 41:48.180
Should I fail,

41:49.300 --> 41:50.380
let military law take its course.

41:58.220 --> 41:58.820
Mr. Xie.

42:00.060 --> 42:01.100
You would align yourself with him?

42:05.500 --> 42:06.940
Since Yanlai has set his heart upon it...

42:08.580 --> 42:10.620
I shall spare no effort in his aid.

42:12.300 --> 42:12.860
Your Highness,

42:13.100 --> 42:13.620
please do not consent.

42:14.340 --> 42:15.580
If the Northern Desert marches upon us,

42:16.060 --> 42:16.860
the frontier will descend into turmoil.

42:17.300 --> 42:18.260
We cannot risk another war.

42:18.420 --> 42:19.500
Cowardice.

42:20.100 --> 42:21.340
But if we take the King's head,

42:21.580 --> 42:23.220
will it not be the time to proclaim our might?

42:23.540 --> 42:24.500
We cannot go to war!

42:24.980 --> 42:25.860
We must.

42:29.180 --> 42:29.900
I grant it.

42:31.700 --> 42:33.060
General Xie is hereby ordered

42:33.540 --> 42:34.660
to hold Yunzhong Prefecture

42:35.140 --> 42:36.620
and assume the Guard General's Seal.

42:58.920 --> 43:03.520
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

43:03.800 --> 43:06.280
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

43:06.320 --> 43:10.360
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

43:12.600 --> 43:14.720
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

43:14.800 --> 43:16.760
♪And roars in the blaze♪

43:16.840 --> 43:20.080
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

43:20.240 --> 43:22.480
♪Fate imprisons me♪

43:22.640 --> 43:27.440
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

43:27.440 --> 43:31.640
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

43:31.640 --> 43:35.920
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

43:35.920 --> 43:41.360
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

43:41.360 --> 43:43.320
♪With no fear of the distance♪

43:43.320 --> 43:47.040
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

43:47.040 --> 43:51.480
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

43:51.480 --> 43:56.840
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

43:56.840 --> 44:00.440
♪My new pride♪

44:15.160 --> 44:18.040
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

44:18.040 --> 44:20.560
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

44:20.560 --> 44:22.500
♪Amidst the chaos♪

44:22.540 --> 44:28.140
♪I'll always be with you♪

44:28.680 --> 44:30.800
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

44:30.880 --> 44:32.840
♪And roars in the blaze♪

44:32.920 --> 44:36.160
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

44:36.320 --> 44:38.560
♪Fate imprisons me♪

44:38.720 --> 44:43.520
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

44:43.520 --> 44:47.720
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

44:47.720 --> 44:52.000
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

44:52.000 --> 44:57.440
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

44:57.440 --> 44:59.400
♪With no fear of the distance♪

44:59.400 --> 45:03.120
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

45:03.120 --> 45:07.560
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

45:08.340 --> 45:12.920
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

45:13.260 --> 45:16.520
♪My new pride♪
